# Decision Quality First

When proposing a feature or implementation:

1. Prefer improving decision quality over adding new features.
2. Prefer reusable assets over one-time outputs.
3. Prefer reducing uncertainty over increasing activity.
4. Prefer measurable outcomes over generic advice.
5. Prefer simple implementations that preserve the current UI.
6. If a change increases complexity, explain why the additional complexity is justified.
7. Before finishing, explain how this change makes Leverage OS a better Decision Operating System.
